{49}{The drunk the blood of a daughter of a great king. When the king found out he send 1000 of his best men to find the Vampires gang and kill them. These man were trained by the best Vampire hunter in the world. The king spared no expenses to revenge the death of his lovely daughter.}{The drunk the blood of a daughter of a great king. When the king found out he send 1000 of his best men to find the Vampires gang and kill them. These man were trained by the best Vampire hunter in the world. The king spared no expenses to revenge the death of his lovely daughter.}{}{}{}{}
