{52}{And what did you do to satisfy your need for blood ?}{}{1}{}{53}{}
{53}{I killed animals and drunk their blood. And every 2 months when the need for Human blood arose i tried to find the most evil person to kill}{I killed animals and drunk their blood. And every 2 months when the need for Human blood arose i tried to find the most evil person to kill}{}{}{}{}
