{62}{ A vampire with all the advantages but none of the disadvantages. My god !}{}{1}{}{64}{}
{63}{Such power in your hands }{}{1}{}{64}{re -20}
{64}{Yes its the same artifact that you brought back on me. And remember. A vampire has an advantage against others only at night. At day he is as weak as an ordinary human. And the artifact  does not change that. When i finally understood that they would kill my family in order to steal the artifact i tried to stall them .By afternoon i thought that they would not kill us until the dawn. But i was wrong. The the bastards killed them and then they hit me and left me for dead .I was ready to die until the sun finally set. In a minute i was healthy again. But they had gone. }{Yes its the same artifact that you brought back on me. And remember. A vampire has an advantage against others only at night. At day he is as weak as an ordinary human. And the artifact  does not change that. When i finally understood that they would kill my family in order to steal the artifact i tried to stall them .By afternoon i thought that they would not kill us until the dawn. But i was wrong. The the bastards killed them and then they hit me and left me for dead .I was ready to die until the sun finally set. In a minute i was healthy again. But they had gone. }{}{}{}{}
